# ---> Rust
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/
tmp/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# ---> Python, only used in scripts/.

# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Environments
.env
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# AI stuff
.serena
.claude

# `nix build` leaves its output link here.
/result

# ---> Local working files, never committed.
# Working notes (follow-ups, experiments, negative results, decision log); see AGENTS.md.
/AGENT_LOG.md
# A generated index of the tree, regenerated locally.
/OVERVIEW.md

# ---> A CA state folder, if one is made in the checkout (`ffca --state-dir .`): never committed.
# The CA's key above all.
/ca.key
/ca.crt
/crl.pem
/ledger.toml
/config.toml
/issued/
/invites/
/.lock
# Certificates and keys written into the checkout (`ffca tui --out .`, `ffca issue`).
/*.key
/*.crt
*.p12
*.mobileconfig
